{"id":"0b2d714dc3750960","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-p-uniform-characterization.md","title":"P一致电路族刻画P","display":"thm-p-uniform-characterization — P一致电路族刻画P","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-p-uniform-characterization","aliases":["28-thm-p-uniform-characterization"],"display":"thm-p-uniform-characterization — P一致电路族刻画P","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-p]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 6.12 and Theorem 6.13","source_printed_pages":"111–112","source_pdf_pages":"137–138","source_status":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-p-uniform-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-p-uniform-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-p-uniform-characterization — P一致电路族刻画P"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 6.12 and Theorem 6.13"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"111–112"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"137–138"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\">\\(\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCircFam},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>，电路描述使用该节点的显式二进制编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP},\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf{FP},\\mathbf P\\)</span> 见所列本地定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle1\\rangle\">\\(\\langle1\\rangle\\)</span> 为单比特字串。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PU}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(1^n)=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PU}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(1^n)=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P=\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*: \\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\\left[\\operatorname{PU}((C_n)_n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P=\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*: \\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\\left[\\operatorname{PU}((C_n)_n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>描述函数直接使用本书布尔电路节点的形式构造，消除独立选择未展开的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{desc}\">\\(\\operatorname{desc}\\)</span> 所产生的接口歧义；一致性与语言类的数学条件保持不变。</p>\n<p>生成器接收1^n，保证其输出描述只有多项式长。先生成再求值给出P算法；反向对固定P机器的多项式步计算按时间层展开为电路，生成过程同样是多项式时间。这里只比对原书陈述和生成构造的整体证明，未复核全部门连接规则，故不作为已核验依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 6.12 and Theorem 6.13；印刷 pp.111–112 / PDF pp.137–138。本次核对范围：对应陈述；证明边界见本节，未升级为完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}$；$\\mathbf{BoolCircFam},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]，电路描述使用该节点的显式二进制编码。$\\mathbf{FP},\\mathbf P$ 见所列本地定义；$\\langle1\\rangle$ 为单比特字串。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP},\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PU}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(1^n)=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(C_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf P=\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*: \\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\\left[\\operatorname{PU}((C_n)_n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{desc}","display":false}],"bytes":2264,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-297","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-size-class]]、[[28-df-time-advice-class]]、[[28-thm-p-poly-advice]]、[[28-thm-p-uniform-characterization]]、[[28-thm-nonuniform-hierarchy]]、[[28-df-circuit-eval]]。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","adb92775ec020a0b","dd9febae42d44280"]}